# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is gitignored; never commit real credentials.
#
# CareerOneStop Web API (U.S. Department of Labor). Free; register at
# https://www.careeronestop.org/Developers/WebAPI/registration.aspx
#
# Optional. Without it the pipeline runs and the site builds; occupation pages simply
# carry no description, skills, or O*NET related-occupation list.
CAREERONESTOP_USER_ID=
CAREERONESTOP_TOKEN=
